# text = Imagine to yourself a Don Quixote of eighteen ; a Don Quixote without his corselet , without his coat of mail , without his cuisses ; a Don Quixote clothed in a woolen doublet , the blue color of which had faded into a nameless shade between lees of wine and a heavenly azure ; face long and brown ; high cheek bones , a sign of sagacity ; the maxillary muscles enormously developed , an infallible sign by which a Gascon may always be detected , even without his cap -- and our young man wore a cap set off with a sort of feather ; the eye open and intelligent ; the nose hooked , but finely chiseled .
